   ],
   "weatherEvent": "flood",
   "backdrop": "great_lakes",
   "bossSkill": "summon",
   "waves": 8,
   "title": {
    "en": "Paul Bunyan's Forest",
    "ja": "ポール・バニヤンの森"
   },
   "summary": {
    "en": "A giant lumberjack and his blue ox are the stars of tall tales from the north woods. Defend the lakes as giant animals and tree spirits roam.",
    "ja": "北の森の法螺話には、巨人の木こりと青い牛が登場します。巨大な動物や木の精が歩きまわるなか、湖を守りましょう。"
   },
   "fact": {
    "en": "Paul Bunyan is a folk hero of American logging tall tales, widely known through early 20th-century stories and advertising (around 1916). Babe the Blue Ox is part of the tale. These are tall tales, not history."
